<title>JAPAN: BOJ INJECTS 300 BLN YEN INTO MONEY MARKET -TRADERS.</title>
<headline>BOJ INJECTS 300 BLN YEN INTO MONEY MARKET -TRADERS.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan (BOJ) injected a net 300 billion yen into the money market on Friday, money traders said.</p>
<p>The money market had a projected fund shortage of 280 billion yen coming into the day.</p>
<p>---Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-5473-3748</p>
